# Deployment artifacts produced by build_pb.py.
# Regenerate with:  python build_pb.py IO_Production_Manager_vX.Y.Z.cs
# build_pb.py is deterministic and committed, so any artifact can be rebuilt
# byte-for-byte from its source. Tracking them would add ~82KB of churn per
# rebuild for no information gain. If you ever need to prove exactly what was
# pasted into a PB during an incident, comment this line out.
*.min.cs

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editors / OS
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
